1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,271
G S T R two B mismatch? Start with the records.

2
00:00:03,271 --> 00:00:05,650
Here are three steps for a clearer review.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,081
First, confirm the registration and review period.

4
00:00:09,081 --> 00:00:10,669
Keep both original files.

5
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:13,450
Compare the invoice details and tax amounts.

6
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:17,947
Next, investigate missing records, different amounts, and duplicate matches.

7
00:00:17,947 --> 00:00:22,650
Give each exception a reason, an owner, and a review date.

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,639
Finally, keep the source references and the reviewer’s decision.

9
00:00:26,639 --> 00:00:30,350
A match alone does not establish input tax credit eligibility.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,696
Read the full checklist at do aide dot com slash blog.

11
00:00:34,696 --> 00:00:37,383
Save this guide for your next reconciliation review.
